  "data": {
    "article": {
      "content": "<p>This visual feature presents a series of photographs documenting the recent events on the ground.</p>\n<p>Our reporting team captured these images during their week-long assignment in the region.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sample-gallery-1.jpg\" alt=\"Sample gallery image one\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" /><figcaption>First photograph from the field assignment.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sample-gallery-2.jpg\" alt=\"Sample gallery image two\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" /><figcaption>Second photograph from the field assignment.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sample-gallery-3.jpg\" alt=\"Sample gallery image three\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" /><figcaption>Third photograph from the field assignment.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/sample-gallery-4.jpg\" alt=\"Sample gallery image four\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" /><figcaption>Fourth photograph from the field assignment.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<p>The full set of images, including additional behind-the-scenes captures, will be available in our weekend longread.</p>\n<p>Editorial choices about which photographs to publish were made in consultation with the subjects and their communities.</p>",
